ch as the Tractor Beam, the Cleaver has a rather high price tag. \tFollowing the tradition, the Cleaver has a roomy cargo bay; enough to make anyone flying it rich. \tAccording to some, it also carries special tools that allow it to harvest resources from the surface of mineral-rich planets or moons.","variants":{"Cleaver (Derelict)":{"Dwarf Core":1,"LP144a Battery Pack":1,"Asteroid Scanner":3,"A250 Atomic Thruster":1,"A375 Atomic Steering":1,"Hyperdrive":1},"Cleaver (Defense)":{"Mining Laser":4,"Heavy Laser":2,"Heavy Anti-Missile Turret":1,"Dwarf Core":1,"LP144a Battery Pack":1,"Asteroid Scanner":3,"Outfits Expansion":1,"A370 Atomic Thruster":1,"A255 Atomic Steering":1,"Hyperdrive":1}},"soldAt":[],"obtainable":true,"source":"TheGiraffe3__rumskib"},"Cutlass":{"name":"Cutlass","displayName":"Cutlass","faction":"human","category":"Light Warship","sprite":"ship/pirate cutlass","thumbnail":"thumbnail/pirate cutlass","attributes":{"category":"Light Warship","cost":3500000.0,"shields":5800.0,"hull":1800.0,"required crew":8.0,"bunks":12.0,"mass":230.0,"drag":3.9,"heat dissipation":0.58,"fuel capacity":600.0,"cargo space":56.0,"outfit space":297.0,"weapon capacity":141.0,"engine capacity":90.0},"hardpoints":{"guns":4,"turrets":1,"engines":2,"reverseEngines":0,"bays":{}},"points":[{"t":"engine","x":-12.0,"y":57.5},{"t":"engine","x":12.0,"y":57.5},{"t":"gun","x":-16.0,"y":-38.0},{"t":"gun","x":16.0,"y":-38.0},{"t":"gun","x":-28.5,"y":-27.5},{"t":"gun","x":28.5,"y":-27.5},{"t":"turret","x":0.0,"y":-1.0}],"defaultOutfits":{"Heavy Laser":4,"Heavy Laser Turret":1,"Dwarf Core":1,"LP144a Battery Pack":1,"D14-RN Shield Generator":1,"Small Radar Jammer":1,"Tactical Scanner":1,"Laser Rifle":5,"A370 Atomic Thruster":1,"A255 Atomic Steering":1,"Hyperdrive":1},"description":"This ship is a modified version of a captured Navy Gunboat. Although there is little most pirates can do to improve the already advanced shielding, they can still weld on a few extra hull reinforcements and an extra 