ements in the region of space known as the Deep developed in relative isolation from the rest of human space. One result of that isolation is that their weapons technology mostly uses beam weapons, instead of the energy projectile weapons that are more common elsewhere. \tThe Quadruple Beam Laser is a modified version of the regular Beam Laser. The designers crammed together four beams for better space usage, but at the cost of less accuracy, more heat and less energy efficiency.","soldAt":[],"obtainable":true,"source":"TheGiraffe3__rumskib"},"Quad Laser Turret":{"name":"Quad Laser Turret","faction":"human","category":"Turrets","series":"Turrets","thumbnail":"outfit/laser turret quad","cost":322000.0,"mass":38.0,"attributes":{"index":1041.0,"outfit space":-38.0,"weapon capacity":-38.0,"turret mounts":-1.0,"required crew":1.0,"mass":38.0},"weapon":{"hardpoint offset":-0.5,"inaccuracy":0.5,"turret turn":2.75,"velocity":300.0,"lifetime":1.0,"reload":1.0,"firing energy":2.67,"firing heat":6.4,"shield damage":4.05,"hull damage":5.15},"description":"Unlike the Laser Turret, the quadified version does not turn fast enough to hold off fighter pilots. However, the doubled damage output more than makes up for this slight disadvantage. \tAlthough it would make more sense to mount a Quad Beam Laser on a turret, Deep Sky instead decided to double the lasers held by the normal laser turret as a cheaper way to increase the damage output.","soldAt":[],"obtainable":true,"source":"TheGiraffe3__rumskib"},"Single Plasma Turret":{"name":"Single Plasma Turret","faction":"human","category":"Turrets","series":"Turrets","thumbnail":"outfit/plasma turret single","cost":216000.0,"mass":34.0,"attributes":{"index":1089.0,"outfit space":-34.0,"weapon capacity":-34.0,"turret mounts":-1.0,"required crew":1.0,"mass":34.0},"weapon":{"hardpoint offset":14.0,"inaccuracy":2.0,"turret turn":2.3,"velocity":12.0,"lifetime":40.0,"reload":18.0,"firing energy":30.0,"firing heat":180.0,"hit force":45.0,"shield damage":63.0,"hull damage":25.0,"heat damage":340.0},"description":"The Single Plasma Turret is one plasma cannon mounted on a turret to fire in any direction. While not as powerful as the dual Plasma Turret, it is able to fit on much smaller ships.","soldAt":[],"obtainable":true,"source":"TheGiraffe3__rumskib"},"Quad Plasma Turret":{"name":"Quad Plasma Turret","faction":"human","category":"Turrets","series":"Turrets","thumbnail":"outfit/plasma turret quad","cost":1196000.0,"mass":111.0,"attributes":{"index":1091.0,"outfit space":-111.0,"weapon capacity":-111.0,"turret mounts":-1.0,"required crew":1.0,"mass":111.0},"weapon":{"hardpoint offset":15.0,"inaccuracy":2.0,"turret turn":1.1,"velocity":12.0,"lifetime":40.0,"reload":4.5,"firing energy":30.0,"firing heat":180.0,"hit force":45.0,"shield damage":63.0,"hull damage":25.0,"heat damage":340.0},"description":"The Quad Plasma Turret is even more powerful than the standard Plasma Turret, but its size makes it rather impractical - it costs more than a flight of fighters and would occupy almost all of a medium warship's weapon space. As such, no sane independent captain will use it. \tSo, how about one?","soldAt":[],"obtainable":true,"source":"TheGiraffe3__rumskib"},"Rumskib Triple Gatling Gun":{"name":"Rumskib Triple Gatling Gun","faction":"human","category":"Secondary Weapons","series":"Secondary Weapons","thumbnail":"outfit/trigat","cost":55000.0,"mass":5.0,"attributes":{"index":1143.0,"outfit space":-23.0,"weapon capacity":-23.0,"gun ports":-1.0,"gatling round capacity":9000.0,"mass":5.0},"weapon":{"inaccuracy":4.0,"velocity":16.0,"lifetime":1.0,"reload":3.1,"burst count":200.0,"burst reload":1.2,"firing energy":0.1,"firing heat":7.0},"description":"When Dr. Richard J. Gatling invented the rapid-fire gun bearing his name in the 19th century, he hoped that its destructiveness would lead to the end of war itself. Over a millennium later, this modern incarnation of the Gatling Gun sees action in the stars, a testament to its fundamentally robust design - and Dr. Gatling's naivete. \tThis more powerful incarnation of the weapon fires three bullets simultaneously from a single gun port, at the cost of more energy for each individual shot. \tAmmunition for this weapon can be restocked at any outfitter.","soldAt":[],"obtainable":true,"source":"TheGiraffe3__rumskib"},"Rumskib Quad Gatling Turret":{"name":"Rumskib Quad Gatling Turret","faction":"human","category":"Secondary Weapons","series":"Secondary Weapons","thumbnail":"outfit/gat turret quad","cost":180000.0,"mass":17.0,"attributes":{"index":1152.0,"outfit space":-41.0,"weapon capacity":-41.0,"turret mounts":-1.0,"required crew":1.0,"gatling round capacity":12000.0,"mass":17.0},"weapon":{"inaccuracy":4.0,"turret turn":2.7,"velocity":16.0,"lifetime":1.0,"reload":3.0,"burst count":180.0,"burst reload":1.0,"firing energy":0.12,"firing heat":10.0},"description":"When the war broke out the Pirates had to adapt to the new circumstances. The Quad Gatling Turret was born when a pirate, taking a page from the Gatling Turret, thought to replace the blasters on a Quad Blaster Turret with a double pair of Gatling Guns. \tAmmunition for this weapon can be restocked at any outfitter.","soldAt":[],"obtainable":true,"source":"TheGiraffe3__rumskib"},"Rumskib Triple Gatling Turret":{"name":"Rumskib Triple Gatling Turret","faction":"human","category":"Secondary Weapons","series":"Secondary Weapons","thumbnail":"outfit/gat turret triple","cost":150000.0,"mass":14.0,"attributes":{"index":1151.0,"outfit space":-32.0,"weapon capacity":-32.0,"turret mounts":-1.0,"required crew":1.0,"gatling round capacity":9000.0,"mass":14.0},"weapon":{"inaccuracy":3.0,"turret turn":3.1,"velocity":16.0,"lifetime":1.0,"reload":3.0,"burst count":180.0,"burst reload":1.0,"firing energy":0.09,"firing heat":7.5},"description":"The standard version of the Gatling Turret in the Core. The Triple Gat Turret is an unnerving threat for any honest merchant, with more barrels then the default version. \tAmmunition for this weapon can be restocked at any outfitter.","soldAt":[],"obtainable":true,"source":"TheGiraffe3__rumskib"},"Rumskib Single Gatling Turret":{"name":"Rumskib Single Gatling Turret","faction":"human","category":"Secondary Weapons","series":"Secondary Weapons","thumbnail":"outfit/gat turret single","cost":90000.0,"mass":9.0,"attributes":{"index":1149.0,"outfit space":-15.0,"weapon capacity":-15.0,"turret mounts":-1.0,"required crew":1.0,"gatling round capacity":3000.0,"mass":9.0},"weapon":{"inaccuracy":2.0,"turret turn":4.8,"velocity":16.0,"lifetime":1.0,"reload":3.0,"burst count":180.0,"burst reload":1.0,"firing energy":0.03,"firing heat":2.5},"description":"In an act that would make Dr. Richard J. Gatling spin in his grave with the ferocity of the barrels of his invention, the Gatling Turret was born when a resourceful pirate thought to replace the Energy Blasters on a Blaster Turret with a pair of Gatling Guns. Ever since, the dominion of the Gatling Turret has spread across the Southern Rim, terrorizing merchants and law enforcement alike with its unparalleled ability to tear apart the hulls of ships. \tThe Single Gatling Turret came into existence when a pirate decided that the space requirements for the Gatling Turret were too high and dismounted one of the Gatling guns, creating a turret that turns even faster. As a result, this turret is the best anti-fighter weapon employed by pirates. \tAmmunition for this weapon can be restocked at any outfitter.","soldAt":[],"obtainable":true,"source":"TheGiraffe3__rumskib"}},"systems":{"Illo Nam":{"name":"Illo Nam","pos":[-547.0,-458.0],"government":"Uninhabited","links":[],"planets":[],"source":"TheGiraffe3__rumskib"},"Nashira":{"name":"Nashira","pos":[-207.9,380.6],"government":"Uninhabited","links":["Gienah"],"planets":[],"source":"TheGiraffe3__rumskib"}}}